  "description": "Partial demolition and alteration to existing buildings.  Erection of two storeys over the ground floor retail unit to provide additional retail accommodation and 2 bedroom flat on first floor plus two 2-bedroom flats on second floor at rear of the site (fronting Dolman Road), erection of attached part 3 and part 4 storey building to provide 1 x two-bedroom,  live/work unit, 1 x one bedroom flat and 4 x two bedroom flats",
